      "widgets_values": [
        "Create a premium vertical e-commerce product story for the women's lingerie bra shown in @image_1. Use the uploaded product photograph as the primary visual reference. Preserve the product's exact color, silhouette, cup shape, straps, lace texture and construction wherever visible. Create a cohesive luxury editorial design in warm ivory, muted taupe and soft charcoal with refined photographic lighting, realistic material detail and elegant negative space. Arrange a long scrolling page with six visually distinct zones: (1) impactful hero product introduction, (2) refined fabric and lace close-up, (3) support and fit visual, (4) tasteful fashion-editorial styling scene, (5) construction detail and craftsmanship macro, (6) minimal closing product card. Consistent art direction, highly photorealistic, premium online store presentation. Do not invent prices, technical certifications, product claims, brand names or logos. Prioritize visual storytelling over text; use minimal readable headings if needed.",
        "ecommerce",
        "medium",
        "2k",
        "BLOCKED - do not send API request",
        6
      ],
